# YouTube Downloader Bot (Pyrogram)

Telegram bot that downloads YouTube videos/audio with live progress bars.

Style inspired by the Facebook downloader bot.

## Features

- Auto-detects YouTube links
- Quality options: Best / 720p / 480p (fast) / Audio MP3
- Automatic 480p for videos longer than 1 hour (faster download)
- Live progress bar during download
- Thumbnail + correct duration/width/height
- Supports streaming on Telegram
- Automatic cleanup of temporary files

## Requirements

- Python 3.11+
- FFmpeg (included in Dockerfile)
- Telegram API credentials from [my.telegram.org](https://my.telegram.org)
- Bot token from [@BotFather](https://t.me/BotFather)

## Environment Variables

| Variable   | Description                          |
|------------|--------------------------------------|
| `API_ID`   | Telegram API ID                      |
| `API_HASH` | Telegram API Hash                    |
| `BOT_TOKEN`| Bot token from @BotFather            |

## Local Run

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
# Make sure ffmpeg is installed
export API_ID=your_api_id
export API_HASH=your_api_hash
export BOT_TOKEN=your_bot_token
python bot.py